      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Prospect%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Prospect High School, the only high school in the village, opened in 1959 and has produced notable alumni like American Idol winner Lee DeWyze.",
